@page "/About"
@layout AuthLayout
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<div class="main-content-box-auth">
    
    <div class="about-box">
        <h2>MultiPlaner</h2>
        <p>MultiPlaner is a web application designed to help users manage their events and projects efficiently. It provides a user-friendly interface for creating, organizing, and tracking events, making it easier to stay productive and meet deadlines.</p>
        <p>With MultiPlaner, you can create multiple calendars, add events to each calendar. The application also offers features like task prioritization, notifications, and collaboration tools to enhance your productivity.</p>
        <p>Whether you're an individual looking to manage personal calendar or organising team events, MultiPlaner is the perfect solution to keep you organized and focused.</p>

        <div class="credits">
            <span>Fabian Skrzypczyński</span>
            <span class="credits-promotor">Promotor: Marcin Badurowicz</span>
            <span>Bartosz Sołyga</span>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

